# Line-ending policy.
#
# Machine-generated OpenAPI specs are always written with LF by
# packages/api-types/scripts/pull-openapi.mjs. Without this, Windows'
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites them to CRLF on checkout, so the next re-pull
# (which writes LF again) shows the whole file as "modified" — phantom diffs
# with no real content change. Pin them to LF so every OS agrees.
packages/api-types/generated/*.json text eol=lf
